<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Is Keyonte George’s Contract at Utah?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>George signed the rookie scale with Utah in 2023, four years and <strong>$18.82m</strong> fully guaranteed. This is the final season, and the club exercised both of its options, in October 2024 and October 2025.</p>
<p>He agreed a five-year extension on September 18, 2026 worth up to <strong>$157.5m</strong>: <strong>$155m</strong> in base salary plus <strong>$500k</strong> a year in incentives, with no options. It starts in 2027-28 and runs to 2031-32, so instead of reaching restricted free agency next summer he is signed until 2032, when he will be 28.</p>

