<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/keyonte-george/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/keyonte-george/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Keyonte George’s Salary in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"George earns $6.56m in 2026-27, seventh at Utah and the last year of his rookie contract. It rises from $4.28m last season. His career earnings come to $18.82m across four seasons, all at Utah. The salary is 3.59% of the club’s $182.97m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Keyonte George Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The rookie contract ends after this season, and his five-year extension takes over in 2027-28. It is worth $155m in base salary with up to $2.5m more in incentives, and runs to 2031-32, when he will be 28."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Keyonte George Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $6.56m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Keyonte George’s Contract at Utah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"George signed the rookie scale with Utah in 2023, four years and $18.82m fully guaranteed. This is the final season, and the club exercised both of its options, in October 2024 and October 2025. He agreed a five-year extension on September 18, 2026 worth up to $157.5m: $155m in base salary plus $500k a year in incentives, with no options. It starts in 2027-28 and runs to 2031-32, so instead of reaching restricted free agency next summer he is signed until 2032, when he will be 28."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Keyonte George’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"George’s net worth is estimated at around $7.53m, taken from his $18.82m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played one season at Baylor and Utah took him 16th in 2023, five months before he turned 20."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Keyonte George on a Rookie Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"George is paid $6.56m because the rookie scale fixes the number by draft position, and the 16th pick is paid what the 16th pick is paid."}}]}</script>
